WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.591
- So a father brought his young son

00:00:01.591 --> 00:00:04.389
into an elephant enclosure
in the San Diego Zoo.

00:00:04.389 --> 00:00:07.040
Clearly this is incredible illegal.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.470
The video is haunting,

00:00:08.470 --> 00:00:10.276
and it's amazing that no one got hurt.

00:00:10.276 --> 00:00:12.800
(elephant grunting)

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.340
But the man was arrested.

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:15.490
And of course, people have asked,

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.180
what is he going to be charged with?

00:00:17.180 --> 00:00:18.610
Well, the obvious things here

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:19.940
are probably criminal trespass.

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:21.300
Just because you have permission

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.570
to be in the San Diego
Zoo generally doesn't mean

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:25.580
you can go into the elephant enclosure

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:26.456
or the lion enclosure.

00:00:26.456 --> 00:00:28.830
Then of course there is the child neglect

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:30.030
and child endangerment.

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:32.416
Here, this is manifestly reckless conduct.

00:00:32.416 --> 00:00:35.010
This is the kind of thing

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.885
that you don't want any parent ever doing.

00:00:36.885 --> 00:00:39.090
And it's definitely not worth the selfies

00:00:39.090 --> 00:00:40.560
to endanger your child.

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.260
And this is exactly the kind of thing

00:00:42.260 --> 00:00:44.069
that the authorities are
going to take a hard look at,

00:00:44.069 --> 00:00:45.760
because the father was being

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:48.057
incredibly, incredibly stupid.

00:00:48.057 --> 00:00:49.455
So don't be like this father

00:00:49.455 --> 00:00:50.876
and don't endanger your child,

00:00:50.876 --> 00:00:53.153
or I will see you in court.

